          "snippet": {
            "line": 282,
            "text": "theorem angular_lag_primitive_iff\n    (H Q : ℝ → ℝ) (x Hx Qx Sq : ℝ)\n    (hH : HasDerivAt H Hx x) (hQ : HasDerivAt Q Qx x) (hHne : H x ≠ 0) :\n    HasDerivAt (fun y => y * H y * Q y) (H x * Sq) x ↔\n      x * Qx + (1 + x * Hx / H x) * Q x = Sq"
          }
        }
      }
    }
